                <h4>Agricultural Inspection at HNL:</h4>
                <p>
                    All arriving passengers must clear agricultural inspection - a unique Hawaii requirement.
                    Requirements:
                </p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Declare all plants, animals, and food products</li>
                    <li>No fresh fruits or vegetables may leave the airport without inspection</li>
                    <li>Pets require health certificates and quarantine compliance</li>
                    <li>Violations carry significant penalties</li>
                </ul>
                <p>This inspection protects Hawaii's fragile ecosystem from invasive species that could devastate native flora and fauna.</p>

